    "Local and remote have diverged. Pick \"Pull and rebase\" or \"Pull (only if no merge needed)\" from the Pull menu." : {
      "comment" : "Quoted names are Pull menu items; keep them matching the localized menu titles.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
